{"id":"b5c14b388ec6d30c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-minimizer.md","title":"Minimizer","display":"df-minimizer — Minimizer","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-minimizer","aliases":["58-df-minimizer","Minimizer"],"display":"df-minimizer — Minimizer","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-functional.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-minimizer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-minimizer</span><span>Minimizer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimizer — Minimizer"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06de3c2036c1fe43\" href=\"?note=06de3c2036c1fe43\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-functional.md\">../batch17/58-df-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c800033782eba35e\" href=\"?note=c800033782eba35e\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md\">../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1f6d4733dbaf832\" href=\"?note=a1f6d4733dbaf832\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md\">../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J: \\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathbb{R} \\cup \\{\\infty\\}\">\\(J: \\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathbb{R} \\cup \\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> (functional on admissible set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u \\in \\mathcal{A}\">\\(u \\in \\mathcal{A}\\)</span> (candidate minimizer)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Minimizer}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Minimizer}_S\\)</span> (defined here; minimizer predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimizer} \\vdash \\mathrm{Minimizer}_S(u,J,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb R\\cup\\{+\\infty\\})\\land u\\in\\mathcal A\\land J(u)&lt;+\\infty\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal A\\;(J(u)\\leq J(v))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimizer} \\vdash \\mathrm{Minimizer}_S(u,J,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb R\\cup\\{+\\infty\\})\\land u\\in\\mathcal A\\land J(u)&lt;+\\infty\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal A\\;(J(u)\\leq J(v))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimizer: a point in the explicitly declared domain at which a set-coded extended-real functional attains its global minimum.</li>\n<li>Direct method: minimize sequence has convergent subsequence; limit is minimizer</li>\n<li>Weak minimizer: satisfies EL equations weakly; sufficient for many PDEs</li>\n<li>Regularity: elliptic regularity implies minimizer is smooth for smooth coefficients</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dacorogna, Introduction to the Calculus of Variations</li>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"06de3c2036c1fe43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md","status":"resolved","id":"c800033782eba35e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-critical-value.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1f6d4733dbaf832","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J: \\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathbb{R} \\cup \\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}","display":false},{"tex":"u \\in \\mathcal{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Minimizer}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimizer} \\vdash \\mathrm{Minimizer}_S(u,J,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb R\\cup\\{+\\infty\\})\\land u\\in\\mathcal A\\land J(u)<+\\infty\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathcal A\\;(J(u)\\leq J(v))","display":true}],"bytes":1433,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-848","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-minimizer.md|58-df-minimizer]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["06de3c2036c1fe43","c800033782eba35e","a1f6d4733dbaf832","36d7463d215be751"]}